    "body": "With https://github.com/kana/vim-submode , I can enter into a mode from different submode trigger that has more than one possible `postkeys` to do one or more post actions. For example here's my 'changetab' mode setup with it\r\n\r\n``` lua\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"gt\", \"gt\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"gT\", \"gT\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Right>\", \"gt\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Left>\", \"gT\")\r\n\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"t\", \"gt\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"T\", \"gT\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<Right>\", \"gt\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<Left>\", \"gT\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Right>\", \"gt\")\r\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Left>\", \"gT\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs that possible to achieve with mini.clue or planned as a feature if not so?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">With <a href=\"https://github.com/kana/vim-submode\">https://github.com/kana/vim-submode</a> , I can enter into a mode from different submode trigger that has more than one possible <code class=\"notranslate\">postkeys</code> to do one or more post actions. For example here's my 'changetab' mode setup with it</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"            vim.fn[&quot;submode#enter_with&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#enter_with&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#enter_with&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;A-Right&gt;&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#enter_with&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;A-Left&gt;&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;)\n\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;t&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;T&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Right&gt;&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Left&gt;&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;A-Right&gt;&quot;, &quot;gt&quot;)\n            vim.fn[&quot;submode#map&quot;](&quot;changetab&quot;, &quot;n&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&lt;A-Left&gt;&quot;, &quot;gT&quot;)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#enter_with<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#enter_with<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#enter_with<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;A-Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#enter_with<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;A-Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>t<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>T<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;A-Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n            <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>submode#map<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>](<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>changetab<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;A-Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is that possible to achieve with mini.clue or planned as a feature if not so?</p>",
    "bodyText": "With https://github.com/kana/vim-submode , I can enter into a mode from different submode trigger that has more than one possible postkeys to do one or more post actions. For example here's my 'changetab' mode setup with it\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"gt\", \"gt\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"gT\", \"gT\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Right>\", \"gt\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#enter_with\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Left>\", \"gT\")\n\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"t\", \"gt\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"T\", \"gT\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<Right>\", \"gt\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<Left>\", \"gT\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Right>\", \"gt\")\n            vim.fn[\"submode#map\"](\"changetab\", \"n\", \"\", \"<A-Left>\", \"gT\")\nIs that possible to achieve with mini.clue or planned as a feature if not so?",
