            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Submodes in 'mini.clue' work better if there is a common prefix that initiates it. For example, something like `<Leader>t` for tabpages. This is mostly to have clues shown *only* for that particular submode.\r\n\r\nAlso 'mini.clue' doesn't create any mappings for user (by design), so you'd need to create them manually.\r\n\r\nHowever, something like you describe seems possible. Try something like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.clue').setup({\r\n  clues = {\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gt',         desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<Right>',   desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<A-right>', desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gT',         desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<Left>',    desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<A-left>',  desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\r\n  },\r\n  triggers = {\r\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g' },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n\r\nlocal remap = function(lhs, rhs, desc)\r\n  vim.keymap.set('n', lhs, rhs, { remap = true, desc = desc })\r\nend\r\nremap('<A-right>',  'gt', 'Next tab')\r\nremap('g<A-right>', 'gt', 'Next tab')\r\nremap('g<Right>',   'gt', 'Next tab')\r\nremap('<A-left>',   'gT', 'Prev tab')\r\nremap('g<A-left>',  'gT', 'Prev tab')\r\nremap('g<Left>',    'gT', 'Prev tab')\r\n```\r\n\r\nDoes this answer your question?",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Submodes in 'mini.clue' work better if there is a common prefix that initiates it. For example, something like <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;Leader&gt;t</code> for tabpages. This is mostly to have clues shown <em>only</em> for that particular submode.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also 'mini.clue' doesn't create any mappings for user (by design), so you'd need to create them manually.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">However, something like you describe seems possible. Try something like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require('mini.clue').setup({\n  clues = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gt',         desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g&lt;Right&gt;',   desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g&lt;A-right&gt;', desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gT',         desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g&lt;Left&gt;',    desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g&lt;A-left&gt;',  desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n  },\n  triggers = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g' },\n  },\n})\n\nlocal remap = function(lhs, rhs, desc)\n  vim.keymap.set('n', lhs, rhs, { remap = true, desc = desc })\nend\nremap('&lt;A-right&gt;',  'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('g&lt;A-right&gt;', 'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('g&lt;Right&gt;',   'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('&lt;A-left&gt;',   'gT', 'Prev tab')\nremap('g&lt;A-left&gt;',  'gT', 'Prev tab')\nremap('g&lt;Left&gt;',    'gT', 'Prev tab')\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.clue<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">clues</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,         <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,   <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;A-right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,         <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;A-left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">postkeys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n  },\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">triggers</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    { <span class=\"pl-smi\">mode</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">keys</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>},\n  },\n})\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">remap</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">lhs</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">rhs</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span>)\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">lhs</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">rhs</span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">remap</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> })\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;A-right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;A-right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,   <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gt<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Next tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;A-left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,   <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;A-left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,  <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">remap</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>g&lt;Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,    <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>gT<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Prev tab<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Does this answer your question?</p>",
            "bodyText": "Submodes in 'mini.clue' work better if there is a common prefix that initiates it. For example, something like <Leader>t for tabpages. This is mostly to have clues shown only for that particular submode.\nAlso 'mini.clue' doesn't create any mappings for user (by design), so you'd need to create them manually.\nHowever, something like you describe seems possible. Try something like this:\nrequire('mini.clue').setup({\n  clues = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gt',         desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<Right>',   desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<A-right>', desc = 'Next tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'gT',         desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<Left>',    desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g<A-left>',  desc = 'Prev tab', postkeys = 'g' },\n  },\n  triggers = {\n    { mode = 'n', keys = 'g' },\n  },\n})\n\nlocal remap = function(lhs, rhs, desc)\n  vim.keymap.set('n', lhs, rhs, { remap = true, desc = desc })\nend\nremap('<A-right>',  'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('g<A-right>', 'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('g<Right>',   'gt', 'Next tab')\nremap('<A-left>',   'gT', 'Prev tab')\nremap('g<A-left>',  'gT', 'Prev tab')\nremap('g<Left>',    'gT', 'Prev tab')\nDoes this answer your question?",
